## Architecture (implement in this order)

| Step | File(s) | Purpose |
|------|---------|---------|
| 1 | `src/theme.ts` | Colors, spacing, radii, typography scale |
| 2 | `src/components/ui/IconButton.tsx` | Back, restart, settings |
| 3 | `src/components/ui/SegmentedControl.tsx` | Spin / english selectors |
| 4 | `src/components/ui/PowerMeter.tsx` | Charge UI |
| 5 | `src/components/GameHud.tsx` | Shared shell; game-specific score slots |
| 6 | `src/i18n.ts` | Add `confirmRestart`, `menu`, section labels if needed |

**Refactor targets:** `BilliardsView.tsx`, `FourBallView.tsx` (replace inline HUD), `SettingsScreen.tsx` (shared back), `SettingsContext.tsx` (gap constant).

**Do not add** a heavy UI library — use RN core + `@expo/vector-icons` (already in Expo).

