## Phased Implementation

### Phase 1 — Foundation
- Add `theme.ts`
- Build `IconButton` + `GameHudNav` (back, restart with confirm)
- Wire into both game views; use `t(lang, 'back')`

### Phase 2 — Scoreboard
- Extract `Scoreboard` with slots for 3-cushion vs 4-ball center content
- Typography + active-player treatment; relocate turn/status

### Phase 3 — Controls
- `SegmentedControl`, `PowerMeter` card, AI thinking polish

### Phase 4 — Win flow & consistency
- Win overlay modal; align Intro + Settings with theme tokens

### Phase 5 — Polish (optional)
- `expo-haptics` on press; light transitions; dark HUD mode

