## Constraints

1. Retest ball sizing if `BOARD_UI_GAP` changes from 140
2. Test Korean strings (“재시작”, “뒤로”) on small screens
3. Keep game logic untouched — UI-only changes in components/styles
4. Any HUD edit today requires two files until `GameHud` is extracted — prioritize extraction first

